{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791663720, "covers_from": "2026-10-10T20:22:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-10T20:23:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791663780, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-10T20:22:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 6009, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "公共安全", "content": "一直砍樹 大樹都被砍斷\n捷運座椅把手被拆\n蓋那麼多火葬場\n這麼會執行中國交辦的任務 置市民於水火", "display_name": "文山代表 No.6,009", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-10T20:22:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 28931, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "教育", "content": "台北市去年上線的學校圖書館系統，設計雜亂無章，系統功能各自獨立沒有串聯，操作不符人性，請市長救救志工", "display_name": "文山代表 No.28,931", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-10T20:22:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 5196, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "車種不再分流，機車不是賤民", "display_name": "大安代表 No.5,196", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-10T20:22:35+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 2504, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "在台北可以方便的租借到ubike,是很快樂的但是腳踏車道和行人道往往因為規劃不實帶來困擾 希望改善", "display_name": "中山代表 No.2,504", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-10T20:22:50+00:00", "duration_seconds": 10, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 50980, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "如果，你當選市長，勞工退休金未依據勞基法辦理，勞工該怎麼辦？", "display_name": "文山代表 No.50,980", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 28931, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.28,931", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 5196, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.5,196", "district": "daan", "is_repl